<title>USA: Hillside, Ill., won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings.</title>
<headline>Hillside, Ill., won by Harris Trust &amp; Savings.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $2.200 million of Hillside, Ill., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.55 percent.</p>
